        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "b77cb8f4-3d7a-4c71-a2f6-39eefeb313d1",
      "content": "Retirement Matching\n\nNorthstar offers retirement contribution matching after 3 months of service. The company match is up to 4% of eligible earnings, subject to payroll country rules and plan eligibility.\n\nExact compensation formulas and salary bands are not included in this benefits overview.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "document_title": "Benefits Overview",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "71a7e7e6-af8a-4b5d-b77b-852b30df7f5a",
      "content": "Classification Levels\n\nNorthstar uses four data classification levels: Public, Internal, Confidential, and Restricted.\n\nPublic data is approved for external sharing. Internal data is intended for Northstar employees. Confidential data includes customer business information, financial forecasts, non-public sales materials, and employee operational data. Restricted data includes secrets, credentials, regulated customer data, privileged security records, and sensitive HR case material.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-003",
      "document_title": "Data Classification and Handling Policy",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "64f32d21-dc10-42cc-b275-395f3ef6f1e6",
      "content": "Health Benefits\n\nNorthstar provides health, dental, and vision benefits to eligible full-time employees. Coverage begins on the first day of the month after the employee's start date. Plan details vary by employee location.\n\nThis overview does not include provider contracts, claim adjudication rules, or legal advice about benefits eligibility.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "document_title": "Benefits Overview",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "037fbef6-587e-4d72-9f87-b78e4060a1e4",
      "content": "Ideal Customer Profile\n\nNorthstar is best suited for operations teams with complex approvals, recurring data quality issues, and reporting delays across multiple departments. Strong-fit customers often have 500 to 5,000 employees and existing workflow tools that lack executive reporting.\n\nPriority industries are finance operations, healthcare operations, logistics, and professional services.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002005",
      "document_id": "SALES-001",
      "document_title": "Sales Playbook",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "19356584-26af-4941-b6fe-9e95dea899e0",
      "content": "Product Limitations\n\nNorthstar is not a replacement for a system of record, identity provider, ERP, or clinical decision system. Sales Representatives should not promise unsupported integrations, exact roadmap delivery dates, or customer-specific contract commitments.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002005",
      "document_id": "SALES-002",
      "document_title": "Product Positioning and FAQ",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    }
  ],
